<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef weak on moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round and loin cuts weak, while rib cuts generally steady. Beef trimmings sharply lower on moderate demand and heavy</p>
<p>offerings.-USDA</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>310 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>117 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>54 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     102.98	102.28	 96.52	 95.92</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.90	 -0.91	 -0.84	 -0.72</p>
<p>Rib	  158.13	156.53	148.70	147.90</p>
<p>Chuck	 69.64	 66.74	 68.65	 66.35</p>
<p>Round	 87.82	 87.82	 84.02	 84.02</p>
<p>Loin	 169.96	171.56	149.78	150.60</p>
<p>Brisket     57.21	 57.21	 57.55	 57.55</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  61.30	 61.23	 61.51	 61.36</p>
<p>Flank	 56.46	 56.46	 55.38	 55.38</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
